'''Banana peels''' can be found during the fight with [[Ba-Ba]] in the [[Tombs of Amascut]]. Two banana peels are spawned after killing [[baboon]]s only when the "Jungle Japes" invocation is active. If the peels are stepped on, the player takes small amounts of damage and is left [[Stun (status)|stunned]] for 3 seconds.

